      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: -10px;">"BUILDING A BETTER WORLD SINCE 1882"</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 65%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="header-box" style="width: 400px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">Virginia State University</p>
